    [ok ] alpha is a root of X^2-2X-1
    [ok ] alphabar is the conjugate root
    [ok ] alpha = 1+sqrt2  alpha = 2.414213562373
    [ok ] rho = 1/alpha = -alphabar = sqrt2-1  rho = 0.414213562373
